Four families whose matrices reach 108–156 columns.  After `Ω_{Ω_{ω·3}}` the patch
breaks no pair of `TrioRulesAll` (`TrioFixNonLastOther`: 526); after `Ω_{Ω_{ω+2}}`,
`Ω_{Ω_{Ω_ω}}`, `Ω_{Ω_{ω^2+1}}` it still breaks 52, 24, 22 (`TrioFixNonLastOther`: 776,
313, 834).  `famCounts` as in `TrioFixNonLastOther2Sheet.lean`.  This file belongs to the
library `GoogologySheets`.  All of it is `#guard`s: a calibration, not a theorem.
-/

